WEBVTT

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:04.976
Railroad workers, mafia, military
and possibly a monster like Loch Ness --

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.360
no one can prove it.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:08.120
Ignore the math.

00:02:08.919 --> 00:02:11.720
Odds are a distraction.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.640
What matters is the chip count.

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:18.016
The cards on the table,

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:20.616
the cards in your hand.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.360
You must be willing to lose.